# Research governance
- Classify incoming material as evidence, hypothesis, requirement, implementation idea, or unverified claim.
- Preserve source and date metadata when available.
- Do not turn a trading concept into a mandatory rule without rationale and scope.
- Record accepted architectural changes as ADRs in `decisions/`.
- Keep rejected ideas with reasons so they are not repeatedly reconsidered.
